description=WCX Zygisk deployment (@MANAGER@). Injects the enabled WeChat instances into their main and child processes. KernelSU/APatch select targets in the module WebUI; Magisk always targets com.tencent.mm. Do not keep the WCX LSPosed scope enabled for the same instance.
